OL,3,GNEWSAPimp your pumpkin if it's too
OL,4,Asmall to carve, drought-hit farmers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalloween fans are being encouraged to
OL,7,F"pimp" their pumpkins if they are too
OL,8,Fsmall to carve following the summer
OL,9,Fdrought.
OL,11,FFree paints, plastic teeth and glitter
OL,12,Fare being offered at one popular event
OL,13,Fin Lincolnshire, to make smaller gourds
OL,14,Fmore appealing.
OL,16,FIn East Yorkshire, meanwhile, growers
OL,17,Fsaid constant watering had "saved"
OL,18,Ftheir crop from shrivelling, but at a
OL,19,Ffinancial cost.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
