OL,3,GNEWSAPimp your pumpkin if it's too
OL,4,Asmall to carve, drought-hit farmers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Farmers Union (NFU) said
OL,7,Fsmaller squashes represented a
OL,8,F"valuable opportunity" to help young
OL,9,FHalloween fans understand the role of
OL,10,Fweather in growing crops.
